    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9031" root="حمأ" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمِئُ العَيْنِ</span></b>  A man <i>of an evil eye,</i> (Fr, K,)
<i>who injures with his eye him whom he sees and
admires:</i> no verb belonging to it has been heard.
(Fr, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمِئَةٌ</span> A well (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِئْر</span>) or a spring (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْن</span>)
<i>foul with black, fetid mud.</i> (TA.)

